{"page":24,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:154","surah":2,"ayah":154,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَقُولُوا۟ لِمَن يُقْتَلُ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ أَمْوَٰتٌۢ ۚ بَلْ أَحْيَآءٌ وَلَـٰكِن لَّا تَشْعُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not say that those who are killed in God’s cause are dead; they are alive, though you do not realize it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِمَن","en_gloss":"for (the ones) who","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُقْتَلُ","en_gloss":"are slain","transliteration":"yuq'talu","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَمْوَٰتٌۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"(They are) dead","transliteration":"amwātun","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَحْيَآءٌۭ","en_gloss":"(they are) alive","transliteration":"aḥyāon","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"[and] but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"you (do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَشْعُرُونَ","en_gloss":"perceive","transliteration":"tashʿurūna","verse_key":"2:154"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٥٤","en_gloss":"(154)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:154"}]},{"verse_key":"2:155","surah":2,"ayah":155,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَنَبْلُوَنَّكُم بِشَىْءٍ مِّنَ ٱلْخَوْفِ وَٱلْجُوعِ وَنَقْصٍ مِّنَ ٱلْأَمْوَٰلِ وَٱلْأَنفُسِ وَٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ ۗ وَبَشِّرِ ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We shall certainly test you with fear and hunger, and loss of property, lives, and crops. But [Prophet], give go