7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:157"}]},{"verse_key":"2:158","surah":2,"ayah":158,"ar_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ ٱلصَّفَا وَٱلْمَرْوَةَ مِن شَعَآئِرِ ٱللَّهِ ۖ فَمَنْ حَجَّ ٱلْبَيْتَ أَوِ ٱعْتَمَرَ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْهِ أَن يَطَّوَّفَ بِهِمَا ۚ وَمَن تَطَوَّعَ خَيْرًا فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ شَاكِرٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Safa and Marwa are among the rites of God, so for those who make major or minor pilgrimage to the House it is no offence to circulate between the two. Anyone who does good of his own accord will be rewarded, for God rewards good deeds, and knows everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلصَّفَا","en_gloss":"the Safa","transliteration":"l-ṣafā","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلْمَرْوَةَ","en_gloss":"and the Marwah","transliteration":"wal-marwata","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(are) from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَعَآئِرِ","en_gloss":"(the) symbols","transliteration":"shaʿāiri","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمَنْ","en_gloss":"So whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَجَّ","en_gloss":"performs Hajj","transliteration":"ḥajja","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْبَيْتَ","en_gloss":"(of) the House","transliteration":"l-bayta","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوِ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"awi","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱعْتَمَرَ","en_gloss":"performs Umrah","transliteration":"iʿ'tamara","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"so no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جُنَاحَ","en_gloss":"blame","transliteration":"junāḥa","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"2:158"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration"