those","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَابُوا۟","en_gloss":"who repent[ed]","transliteration":"tābū","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَصْلَحُوا۟","en_gloss":"and reform[ed]","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥū","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَبَيَّنُوا۟","en_gloss":"and openly declar[ed]","transliteration":"wabayyanū","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Then those","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَتُوبُ","en_gloss":"I will accept repentance","transliteration":"atūbu","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَنَا","en_gloss":"and I (am)","transliteration":"wa-anā","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلتَّوَّابُ","en_gloss":"the Acceptor of Repentance","transliteration":"l-tawābu","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"2:160"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٦٠","en_gloss":"(160)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:160"}]},{"verse_key":"2:161","surah":2,"ayah":161,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَمَاتُوا۟ وَهُمْ كُفَّارٌ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ عَلَيْهِمْ لَعْنَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ أَجْمَعِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who disbelieve and die as disbelievers, God rejects them, as do the angels and all people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve[d]","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَاتُوا۟","en_gloss":"and die[d]","transliteration":"wamātū","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كُفَّارٌ","en_gloss":"(were) disbelievers","transliteration":"kuffārun","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَعْنَةُ","en_gloss":"(is the) curse","transliteration":"laʿnatu","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","en_gloss":"and the Angels","transliteration":"wal-malāikati","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"and the mankind","transliteration":"wal-nāsi","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَجْمَعِينَ","en_gloss":"all together","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","verse_key":"2:161"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٦١","en_gloss":"(161)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:161"}]},{"verse_key":"2:162","surah":2,"ayah":162,"ar_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۖ لَا يُخَفَّفُ عَنْهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ وَلَا هُمْ يُنظَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will remain in this state of rejection: their punishment will not be lightened, nor will they be reprieved.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"(Will) abide forever","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِيهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُخَفَّفُ","en_gloss":"will be lightened","transliteration":"yukhaffafu","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَنْهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿanhumu","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُنظَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be reprieved","transliteration":"yunẓarūna","verse_key":"2:162"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٦٢","en_gloss":"(162)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:162"}]},{"verse_key":"2:163","surah":2,"ayah":163,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِلَـٰهُكُمْ إِلَـٰهٌ وَٰحِدٌ ۖ لَّآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your God is the one God: there is no god except Him, the Lord of Mercy, the Giver of Mercy.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِلَـٰهُكُمْ","en_gloss":"And your God","transliteration":"wa-ilāhukum","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) God","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٰحِدٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"one (only)","transliteration":"wāḥidun","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"Him","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Most Gracious","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"2:163"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٦٣","en_gloss":"(163)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:163"}]}]}